* news_process v3.5.0 — Table 6: 8-cell decomposition (D2)
*
* Per v3.5.0 Stage-3 augmentation plan §2.1 (历史方法学文档, 已随 docs/ 目录删除归档):
*   把 substantiveness × locus × collab_mode 三 binary dim 拼成 8 cell categorical treatment,
*   base = cell 1 (实质性·底层技术·自主研发), 跑 i.cell_id_full 回归.
*   解读: 哪些 cell 在 driving main effect, 哪些 cell 是 null.
*
* 文献锚 (per plan §10):
*   Angrist & Pischke (2009) Mostly Harmless Econometrics Ch.5 saturated regression
*   Sun & Abraham (2021 JOE 225) cohort decomposition 类比
*
* Cell 合并决策 (per plan §2.1.4 + framework §2.bis):
*   单 paper Table 6 启动前根据 cell n 应用 Priority A/B/C 合并规则;
*   合并决策 pre-registered, 记录到 audit log §B.cell_merge_history.
*   {{ cell_merge_decisions }}  // 由 stata_runner build-replication 按论文填充
*
* RHS 变量数 (per plan §2.1.5 F25):
*   i.cell_id_full → 7 dummy (8-1 base omitted) + controls (~7) = ~14 RHS.
*   MP 19.5 上限 65,532, IC 上限 798 — 14 << 所有 license.

version 19
clear all
set linesize 120

use "{{ panel_path }}", clear

* --- Step 1: 回归前 cell 合并决策 (per plan §2.1.4) ---
* 若 paper_spec.yaml 中声明了 cell 合并, 在此执行:
* 例: `recode cell_id_full (6 = 4)` 把 cell 6 并入 cell 4 (Priority A).
* 默认 (不合并): cell_id_full 保持 1..8.
{{ cell_merge_recode_block }}

* --- Step 2: 8-cell 分类处理变量回归 ---
* base = cell 1 (sub.tech.indep, 三维全 baseline)
eststo M_cell: reghdfe {{ outcome }} i.cell_id_full {{ controls }} [aw={{ weight }}], ///
    absorb(i.{{ bank_fe }} i.{{ year_fe }}) cluster({{ cluster_var }})

* --- Step 3: 联合 Wald 检验 ---
testparm i.cell_id_full
local F_joint = r(F)
local p_joint = r(p)
display "Joint test F = `F_joint', p = `p_joint'"

* --- Step 4: 输出表 ---
esttab M_cell using "{{ output_dir }}/table6_cell_decomp.tex", ///
    cells(b(star fmt(3)) se(par fmt(3))) ///
    keep(*.cell_id_full) ///
    label nogaps ///
    title("Table 6: 8-cell decomposition (base = cell 1 = 实质性·底层技术·自主研发)") ///
    addnotes("Joint test F=`F_joint', p=`p_joint'." ///
             "Cell merge decisions per plan §2.1.4 logged to audit §B.cell_merge_history.")

* --- Step 5: Coefplot 可视化 (可选) ---
coefplot M_cell, keep(*.cell_id_full) drop(_cons) ///
    xline(0, lcolor(gs8) lpattern(dash)) ///
    title("8-cell decomposition coefficients (base = cell 1)") ///
    xlabel(, angle(0)) ///
    msymbol(O) mcolor(navy) ciopts(lcolor(navy) lwidth(medium))
graph export "{{ output_dir }}/figure_table6_cell_coefplot.pdf", replace
